in="00:12.660" end="00:13.590">energy</span><span begin="00:13.590" end="00:13.770">, </span><span begin="00:13.770" end="00:14.040">I </span><span begin="00:14.040" end="00:14.280">want </span><span begin="00:14.280" end="00:14.580">your </span><span begin="00:14.580" end="00:15.450">aura</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.630" end="00:19.740"><span begin="00:15.630" end="00:15.990">You </span><span begin="00:15.990" end="00:16.140">are </span><span begin="00:16.140" end="00:16.320">my </span><span begin="00:16.320" end="00:17.730">destiny</span><span begin="00:17.730" end="00:17.940">, </span><span begin="00:17.940" end="00:18.180">my </span><span begin="00:18.180" end="00:19.740">mantra</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.040" end="00:23.730"><span begin="00:20.040" end="00:20.520">Never </span><span begin="00:20.520" end="00:20.700">knew </span><span begin="00:20.700" end="00:20.820">I </span><span begin="00:20.820" end="00:20.970">could </span><span begin="00:20.970" end="00:21.120">see </span><span begin="00:21.120" end="00:21.450">something </span><span begin="00:21.450" end="00:21.600">so </span><span begin="00:21.600" end="00:21.930">clearly </span><span begin="00:21.930" end="00:22.260">looking </span><span begin="00:22.260" end="00:22.410">through </span><span begin="00:22.410" end="00:22.530">my </span><span begin="00:22.530" end="00:23.160">third </span><span begin="00:23.160" end="00:23.730">eye</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.880" end="00:27.360"><span begin="00:23.880" end="00:24.300">Never </span><span begin="00:24.300" end="00:24.480">knew </span><span begin="00:24.480" end="00:24.780">karma </span><span begin="00:24.780" end="00:24.960">could </span><span begin="00:24.960" end="00:25.110">be </span><span begin="00:25.110" end="00:25.290">so </span><span begin="00:25.290" end="00:25.800">rewarding </span><span begin="00:25.800" end="00:25.920">and </span><span begin="00:25.920" end="00:26.070">bring </span><span begin="00:26.070" end="00:26.220">me </span><span begin="00:26.220" end="00:26.340">to </span><span begin="00:26.340" end="00:26.760">your </span><span begin="00:26.760" end="00:27.360">life</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.660" end="00:33.480"><span begin="00:27.660" end="00:28.140">Maybe </span><span begin="00:28.140" end="00:28.350">this </span><span begin="00:28.350" end="00:28.470">is </span><span begin="00:28.470" end="00:28.560">the </span><span begin="00:28.560" end="00:29.160">beginning </span><span begin="00:29.160" end="00:29.250">of </span><span begin="00:29.250" end="00:29.550">something </span><span begin="00:29.550" end="00:29.700">so </span><span begin="00:29.700" end="00:30.180">magical</span><span begin="00:30.180" end="00:30.180">, </span><span begin="00:30.180" end="00:31.530">tonight </span><span begin="00:31.530" end="00:31.590">（</span><span begin="00:31.590" end="00:32.280">oh</span><span begin="00:32.280" end="00:32.340">, </span><span begin="00:32.340" end="00:33.450">oh</span><span begin="00:33.450" end="00:33.480">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.480" end="00:37.290"><span begin="00:33.480" end="00:33.960">Take </span><span begin="00:33.960" end="00:34.440">me </span><span begin="00:34.440" end="00:35.400">down </span><span begin="00:35.400" end="00:36.150">to </span><span begin="00:36.150" end="00:36.390">the </span><span begin="00:36.390" end="00:37.290">river</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.380" end="00:40.980"><span begin="00:37.380" end="00:39.030">Underneath </span><span begin="00:39.030" end="00:39.180">the </span><span begin="00:39.180" end="00:39.810">blood </span><span begin="00:39.810" end="00:40.200">orange </span><span begin="00:40.200" end="00:40.980">sun</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.010" end="00:44.910"><span begin="00:41.010" end="00:41.550">Say </span><span begin="00:41.550" end="00:42.060">my </span><span begin="00:42.060" end="00:43.050">name </span><span begin="00:43.050" end="00:43.830">like </s