</span><span begin="01:11.310" end="01:11.340">, </span><span begin="01:11.340" end="01:12.720">forever</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.750" end="01:16.110"><span begin="01:12.750" end="01:12.990">Your </span><span begin="01:12.990" end="01:14.640">cleopatra </span><span begin="01:14.640" end="01:14.940">Your </span><span begin="01:14.940" end="01:15.420">blushing </span><span begin="01:15.420" end="01:16.110">Juliet</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.110" end="01:16.680"><span begin="01:16.110" end="01:16.224">You </span><span begin="01:16.224" end="01:16.338">blushing </span><span begin="01:16.338" end="01:16.452">to </span><span begin="01:16.452" end="01:16.566">the </span><span begin="01:16.566" end="01:16.680">end</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.680" end="01:20.790"><span begin="01:16.680" end="01:17.310">Anything </span><span begin="01:17.310" end="01:17.550">for </span><span begin="01:17.550" end="01:17.760">your </span><span begin="01:17.760" end="01:18.480">love</span><span begin="01:18.480" end="01:18.540">, </span><span begin="01:18.540" end="01:18.720">a </span><span begin="01:18.720" end="01:19.080">ride </span><span begin="01:19.080" end="01:19.170">or </span><span begin="01:19.170" end="01:20.790">die</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.970" end="01:24.450"><span begin="01:20.970" end="01:21.450">Never </span><span begin="01:21.450" end="01:21.660">knew </span><span begin="01:21.660" end="01:21.780">I </span><span begin="01:21.780" end="01:21.930">could </span><span begin="01:21.930" end="01:22.080">see </span><span begin="01:22.080" end="01:22.410">something </span><span begin="01:22.410" end="01:22.560">so </span><span begin="01:22.560" end="01:22.890">clearly </span><span begin="01:22.890" end="01:23.190">looking </span><span begin="01:23.190" end="01:23.340">through </span><span begin="01:23.340" end="01:23.490">my </span><span begin="01:23.490" end="01:24.120">third </span><span begin="01:24.120" end="01:24.450">eye</